config BR2_PACKAGE_MILAN_BRIDGE
	bool "milan-bridge (PocketBeagle 2 USB-to-Milan bridge)"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_MILAN_FPGA_SRC
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LINUXPTP
	help
	  The daemons of the PocketBeagle 2 USB-to-Milan bridge, from
	  milan-linux/ in this BSP: milan-ctrld, the Milan control plane
	  (milan-fpga's Mark II control-plane firmware, unchanged, on a
	  soft fabric over AF_PACKET, netlink and ptp4l's management
	  socket), and milan-dp, which prints the datapath block it
	  publishes. Started by S95avb with AVB_STACK=native through
	  /usr/sbin/milan-bridge.sh. See README.pb2-tsn.md.
